    "title": "Special Weather Statement by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "12 minutes ago Check NWS updates here\nEffective: 2026-04-22 23:07:00 CDT Expires: 2026-04-22 23:30:00 CDT Urgency: Expected Severity: Moderate Certainty: Observed Instruction: If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building. Target Area: Towner; Benson; Ramsey At 1106 PM CDT, Doppler radar was tracking gusty showers along a line extending from near Southam to Harvey. Movement was north at 20 mph.\nHAZARD...Wind gusts of 50 to 55 mph.\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\nIMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around unsecured objects.\nLocations impacted include... Devils Lake, Camp Grafton, Lakewood Park, Leeds, Maddock, Fort Totten, and Minnewaukan.",
